  Description: "COMPANION / RARE / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nA living resident rescued from
    the Lost-Property Vault. Permanent friend; its support and assigned weapon are
    listed below.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nTeam / Damage: +6%\nTier 1/2/3 traits
    \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING
    REALM\nHidden in the lost-property vault after refusing an ownership mark, their
    seams are injuries and chosen repairs. They were not manufactured for somebody.
    They want their name spoken at the table without a claim ticket.\r\nPERSONAL
    PASSIVE\nNo additional periodic personal passive.\r\nSource: dream shop or special
    reward, subject to hero theme and unlock wave.\r\nBonds: archive. Immortal. Weapon
    rolls on recruitment; three equal-species/equal-star bodies merge unless the
    talent forbids it."
